1
00:00:01,583 --> 00:00:03,916
But I can't let them catch me.

2
00:00:04,708 --> 00:00:08,416
There's something important
I still have to do.

3
00:00:08,875 --> 00:00:09,833
Something you have to do?

4
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:11,666
Kindaichi...

5
00:00:12,375 --> 00:00:14,875
Do you remember the fourth verse
of the curse song?

6
00:00:15,375 --> 00:00:16,916
The fourth verse...?

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,666
Descent of the Beautiful Goddess!

8
00:00:19,916 --> 00:00:20,583
Mayura!

9
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:25,000
Mayura, I won't let you
or Mayuki die!

10
00:00:26,583 --> 00:00:28,083
Sayuri...

11
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:30,333
I won't let you!

12
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,708
Mayura, didn't you realise
someone was protecting you?

13
00:00:36,375 --> 00:00:42,375
When you killed Mitsusada, why do
you think Sayuri lied to cover for you?

14
00:00:42,375 --> 00:00:44,375
Have you ever thought about that?

15
00:00:45,541 --> 00:00:46,958
Hajime...

16
00:00:47,875 --> 00:00:49,291
Sayuri...

17
00:00:49,583 --> 00:00:50,958
Tell her the truth.

18
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,791
Tell Mayura you're her sister.

19
00:00:55,166 --> 00:00:55,958
My sister?

20
00:00:56,375 --> 00:00:57,250
That's right.

21
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,958
Sayuri is Mitsusada Hazuki's
daughter.

22
00:01:02,291 --> 00:01:03,875
Hajime...

23
00:01:04,541 --> 00:01:05,958
All right.
